=== intro

A dock worker catches your eye while you're checking manifests. "Hey, captain. Word is Frontier Station's medical supplies are running critically low. Plague or something. Just saying—if someone had supplies to sell..."

They shrug and walk away. Could be gossip. Could be an opportunity.

* [Note the tip]
